class: negative
summary: [1810] ends a statement where its grammar does, so `local =` with its value left out reads the next line as that value; the line break is tried as the repair position and the report is a value missing at the `=`, not an assignment used as an expression on the next line
program: program.ldn
codes: L0102
fixed: program.fixed
constructs: 0390, 1810, 1820
targets: linux-x86-64, linux-arm64, macos-arm64, synthetic-32, freebsd-x86-64, freebsd-arm64, linux-rv64
